<title>USA: MBIA qualifies five muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies five muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Thursday it qualified for bond insurance the following five municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Plattsburgh, N.Y., $3.65 million various purpose bonds.</p>
<p>--Anchorage, Ala., Telephone Utility, $25 million revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Winfield, Ill., $2.665 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Concord, Ind., community schools, $4.7 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Cambridge ISD, Minn., $18.72 million GOs. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
